# publish/ is TRACKED. It holds the status page, install instructions, release notes,
# the to-do list, and the licence texts for the six bundled mods - which are the
# condition that makes redistributing them legitimate. All of that existed only on one
# machine, with no copy anywhere, after a day's work had already been lost once to a
# stray git reset.
#
# Only the build OUTPUT is ignored: FullInstall.zip is reassembled from
# publish/fullinstall-base + the current build on every ship.
publish/FullInstall.zip
